      "scope": "16 Table S1 rows grouped under pressure determined by NaCl",
      "notes": "The article states that these NaCl pressures were checked against the Fei et al. Pt scale and differed by less than 1 GPa from 35 to 67 GPa up to 3000 K, but it does not identify a separate numerical NaCl EOS parameterization."
     }
